# The chapter pages promise that nothing you type leaves the page: the browser enforces it. Pages
# may only talk to this site (the contact form posts to /api/contact) and to Google Analytics, which
# gets page views and clicks on links to the apps, never anything typed or chosen on a page (see
# src/layouts/Base.astro). Everything else is blocked. The Google hosts are the ones GA4's CSP
# guide lists for connect-src.
/*
  Content-Security-Policy: connect-src 'self' https://*.google-analytics.com https://*.analytics.google.com https://*.googletagmanager.com; object-src 'none'; base-uri 'self'
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
